{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04549","headline":"修书院学士奉敕宴梁王宅赋得树字 · 张说","name":"修书院学士奉敕宴梁王宅赋得树字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虎殿成鸿业，猿岩题凤赋。\n既荷大君恩，还蒙小山遇。\n秋吹迎弦管，凉云生竹树。\n共惜朱邸欢，无辞洛城暮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}